# The shared TextField with touch (docs/dev/clipboard.md, P1): a tap puts the caret at the tapped character (tapchar:
# just inside the left edge of that character), in a short field, after multibyte characters, in a long field scrolled to
# its end and in a password field, and a tap ends a selection. No touch bubble or handles yet. Review only.
title text field: tap places the caret
review
sizes 800x480 640x480 480x320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
fielddemo
wait 300
tapchar Name 4
expect_caret Name 4
tapchar Name 0
expect_caret Name 0
tapchar Name 16
expect_caret Name 16
# after the accent and the euro sign: the caret is a character index, the edit a byte offset
tapchar Name 10
expect_caret Name 10
type X
expect_field Name "café €5 anXd more"
shot touch_caret_typed
# a tap ends a selection
key CTRL+A
expect_selection Name 0 17
tapchar Name 3
expect_selection Name none
expect_caret Name 3
# a long field scrolled to its end
tapfield Address
key END
tapchar Address 70
expect_caret Address 70
tapchar Address 66
expect_caret Address 66
shot touch_caret_long
# a password field
tapfield Secret
tapchar Secret 2
expect_caret Secret 2
shot touch_caret_password
